        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "<p><strong>Key bundle opportunities:</strong> The strongest recurring cross-sell pattern is in <em>plumbing/electrical</em> bundles. The most repeated bundle is <strong>PTFE Thread Tape White</strong>, appearing in <strong>4 orders</strong> (orders 56, 57, 571, 669), including one order with <strong>2 units</strong> in the same basket. Other high-value combinations include <strong>Romex Wire 12-2 250ft + Liquid-Tight Conduit + Outlet Box Single Gang + Junction Box 4x4</strong> (order 104) and <strong>GFCI Outlet 20-Amp + Rigid Conduit 1-inch + Multi-Outlet Power Strip</strong> (order 646), showing a clear electrical-install bundle path.</p><p><strong>Store differences:</strong> <em>Zava Retail Tacoma</em> shows broad DIY project baskets, especially early in the timeline, with paint, tools, and hardware frequently grouped together. Examples include <strong>Exterior Acrylic Paint + Semi-Transparent Deck Stain</strong>, <strong>Mouse Sander + Stationary Belt Sander + Garage Ceiling Hoist</strong>, and <strong>Impact Drill 20V + Outlet Box Single Gang</strong>. This suggests Tacoma is strongest for larger project-based bundles, while the broader dataset shows more specialized maintenance bundles like toilet repair, conduit, and pipe-fitting kits.</p><p><strong>Seasonal shifts:</strong> Winter baskets lean toward <em>indoor repair and electrical</em> items: January orders include <strong>Weather Resistant Outlet + Track Lighting Kit</strong>, <strong>USB Outlet with Charging + Double Pole Breaker 30A</strong>, and <strong>Fill Valve Assembly</strong>. Spring and summer shift toward <em>outdoor and landscaping</em> bundles, such as <strong>Oscillating Sprinkler + Misting Sprinkler Kit + Ceramic Planter 12-inch + Topsoil Screened 40lb + Solar Path Light Set</strong> (order 83) and <strong>Slow Release Granules + Topsoil Screened 40lb</strong> (orders 105 and 82). This indicates a strong seasonal merchandising opportunity to swap in garden and irrigation add-ons from late spring through summer.</p><ul><li><strong>Priority bundle:</strong> plumbing tape, augers, wax rings, and pipe fittings should be merchandised together; the tape appears in <strong>4</strong> separate orders and plumbing kits recur across multiple dates.</li><li><strong>Project bundle:</strong> pair saws/sanders with consumables and safety/organization items; Tacoma baskets show multi-tool orders with <strong>3-5 products</strong> frequently.</li><li><strong>Seasonal action:</strong> promote garden soil, mulch, sprinklers, and solar lighting in warmer months; winter should emphasize outlets, breakers, conduit, and repair kits.</li></ul>",
